{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2025-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1759881600, "end_date": 1760572799, "month_true_total": 123, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:04:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "206819565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105991922", "personaname": "Renegade03", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198105991922/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 45558, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 27419, "last_played": 1778800219, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is an awesome game worth the money.", "timestamp_created": 1760572346, "timestamp_updated": 1760572346, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.414784014225006104", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206799240", "author": {"steamid": "76561199266777208", "personaname": "Ethan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EthanThyCrusader/", "num_games_owned": 58, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 2625, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1159, "last_played": 1770051326, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "amazing sniping", "timestamp_created": 1760550788, "timestamp_updated": 1760550788, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.458404064178466797", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206776567", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991535580", "personaname": "Max Enlargement", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/niccy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2067, "last_played": 1760451650, "avatar": "69de66c301fca7224a5c8af70ab7b1ac4ab741e4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Feels rushed. Story feels dull and shallow. The detail is missing. And I don't get why the protagonist sounds like a tough male but is portrayed as a corpulent shy teen with acne. Maybe the developers felt like that would match their playerbase more. Very rude.\n\nAreas feel empty. I have the idea that there are significantly lesser enemies in the game then previous installments. (My settings are the same). I could easily Rambo myself through the missions, because the lack of enemies made tagging and sniping very boring.\n\nAfter completion no urge to replay any mission. Think i'm going to play and ES5 again and gaze in awe of the detailed interiors of bunkers and the masses of AI enemies.\n\nIf you liked the series and want to give this one a try, best to buy it in a sale!", "timestamp_created": 1760528960, "timestamp_updated": 1760528960, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.575974225997924805", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "206751609", "author": {"steamid": "76561197967685254", "personaname": "Andres", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197967685254/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 844, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 356, "last_played": 1760660606, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "As good as Sniper Elite 5.", "timestamp_created": 1760489193, "timestamp_updated": 1760489193, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206708721", "author": {"steamid": "76561199064921300", "personaname": "noelreturn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199064921300/", "num_games_owned": 38, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 324, "last_played": 1782321300, "avatar": "277b8ef90c06ae3bc2c61c30080034263bfd50f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good and fun and cool and awesome", "timestamp_created": 1760447063, "timestamp_updated": 1760447063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206666503", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017122732", "personaname": "Snake", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017122732/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 110, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 110, "last_played": 1760155544, "avatar": "a069c37e65f02cf95fc5d067f9eb3e448a4566bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't waste your money!   To be fair....IF you are going to play this SOLO, then it looks like it would be fun to play, like the other Sniper Elite games.  HOWEVER...if you plan on playing this in co-op with a friend..forget it.  The anti-cheat, or should I say, anti-playable Denovu crap, makes the game unplayable.  It queues up the movement keys so bad, that when you release the key, the character continues to move for anywhere from 7-10 seconds longer.  So off a cliff, into the enemy lines, what ever direction you were heading.  And don't plan on the Devs doing anything about it.  I got an email from them basically saying, it's ok that I got a refund...have a good day. \nAnd before anyone asks, YES I tried every recommended fix/alteration to correct the issue.  The ONLY thing that fixed the issue, was removing Denovu.\nHave a great day guys!", "timestamp_created": 1760390785, "timestamp_updated": 1760390785, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 26, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.641117215156555176", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "206660808", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991250441", "personaname": "DeathWalker76", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991250441/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1924, "last_played": 1784410238, "avatar": "debc7c21030c8bdb8cb04feb007f189e86f93003"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game  Everything works  no bugs", "timestamp_created": 1760385719, "timestamp_updated": 1760385719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206595477", "author": {"steamid": "76561198849486711", "personaname": "SlashRG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198849486711/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 534, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 484, "last_played": 1760315329, "avatar": "8e29c07756dfa953a4871abc77ec3b9aa2909cf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1760312322, "timestamp_updated": 1760312322, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206594145", "author": {"steamid": "76561198098004504", "personaname": "erazerhead99", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198098004504/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 161, "playtime_forever": 811, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 572, "last_played": 1760655803, "avatar": "6438fc2d99cce018c9691a895108a1d1ff570b86"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's an OK game, but essentially it's just more of the same and the story is even worse than in the Sniper Elite 5.\n\nThis series has a good gameplay foundation, but they NEED to evolve in terms of story/mission quality and variety and, even more, in setting diversification. I will not buy another WW2 Sniper Elite game, but i would gladly buy one with a setting in Vietnam war, Korea war, Winter War or any other fresh setting and good story.", "timestamp_created": 1760310797, "timestamp_updated": 1760310797, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 21, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.636264801025390625", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187",